        },
        "description": "Neighbor to the Misogiya family. She is an introverted, bespectacled otaku girl with a fear of men. She makes a living from home as a freelance developer. She likes [Kaoru](https://anilist.co/character/382213), and has the ambition to marry him when he becomes an adult, even though he is still in elementary school.",
