    {
      "role": "SUPPORTING",
      "node": {
        "id": 382221,
        "name": {
          "full": "Amane Hasegawa",
          "native": "初瀬川周",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b382221-2fj6IL6CQzbD.png"
        },
        "description": "[Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/382212)'s classmate.\n\nA girl who was in the same kindergarden class as Hinata. She ended up going to a private elementary and middle school, but was teetering on the border of life and death after [Yamatagi Madara](https://anilist.co/character/400573/) forcibly possessed her. She narrowly survived due to the effects of her supernaturally-accelerated spiritual growth. After aging from 12 years to 15 years old during her brief coma, she had a period of rehab, and then returned to school. Her body is now roughly 16 and a half years old, but her mind is still that of a 12 year old. Despite having enough raw spiritual power to be acknowledged by the great demon, her spiritual sense is poor, so she is completely unaware of her situation.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "16"
      },
