        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b382216-eQZ07XcUd73D.png"
        },
        "description": "[Hinata](https://anilist.co/character/382212) and [Kaoru's](https://anilist.co/character/382213) father. An ophthalmologist. Originally from Australia, he and his family became naturalized Japanese citizens in his childhood and speak fluent Japanese. He met [Chiyo](https://anilist.co/character/382215/) in college, married her, and became [Hyougo](https://anilist.co/character/382214/)'s son-in-law. He has almost no psychic abilities, but he believes in the existence of supernatural phenomena and is cooperative in his duties at the Mitsukiya family home.",
