        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b382217-G5dz7whoj8mK.png"
        },
        "description": "[Kaoru's](https://anilist.co/character/382213/) homeroom teacher. A middle-aged man with an overweight build and glasses. He gives off the impression of a lecherous teacher who preys on his students, but he's actually in his early 30s and is a genuinely honest person who cares deeply for his students. He enjoys sewing and excels at making cosplay costumes, and he and Kaoru get along well. He makes various costumes for Dara, from shrine maiden outfits to maid outfits, at Kaoru's request.",
